WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,130
Where are the people in the house?

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:04,660
The whole first floor of my house is flooded and the furniture has been soaked. Do you care?

3
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,580
This is not a community drainage problem

4
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:07,740
The whole street outside is flooded

5
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:08,660
All takeaways have been stopped

6
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,260
The five of us have been eating instant noodles for two days

7
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:11,980
Can anyone exchange my potato chips for instant noodles?

8
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,990
Only the second day

9
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:15,430
Some people are already starting to lack food.

10
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,200
There are five young people living in this household 602

11
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,160
Be careful in the future

12
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:23,300
Go out and explore the situation

13
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:32,180
What's wrong with opening the door?

14
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:34,020
The child just wants to go in and play for a while

15
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,580
Neighbors must be so stingy

16
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,860
I let him in once yesterday

17
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,820
The house is in a mess. Today is inconvenient.

18
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:45,600
What can a child break?

19
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,160
Do you have some snacks at home?

20
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:48,240
I can’t even bear to give it to my children.

21
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,000
Wherever I got it, the commotion started already
